★★☆","paras":["The technician **put** a new screen on my phone in 20 minutes. He **put** the old parts in a bag, **put** my data back and **put** a protective glass on top.","Staff **put** customers first. Prices are **put** clearly on the wall. I’d **put** it at the top of my list!"],"kicker":"SERVICE REVIEW","by":"Mel, 4 stars","gloss":[["screen","tela"],["data","dados"],["protective","protetor"],["staff","equipe"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The technician put a new screen on.","ans":"T","why":"put a new screen."},{"q":"The repair took two days.","ans":"F","why":"20 minutes."},{"q":"Prices are on the wall.","ans":"T","why":"on the wall."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“protective” = ?","opts":["protetor","profissional","produtivo"],"ans":0,"why":"protective."},{"q":"“data” = ?","opts":["dados","dias","datas"],"ans":0,"why":"data."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: put","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["colocar","**He put a screen on my phone.**"],["classificar","**I’d put it at the top.**"],["expressar","**Let me put it simply.**"],["put off","**Don’t put it off.**"]],"cap":"Key verb: put"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Passado e particípio iguais: **put – put – put**. Cuidado: *I put* pode ser presente ou passado."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"He ___ a new screen on. (put, past)","a":"put","why":"put-put."},{"s":"She ___ the parts in a bag. (put, past)","a":"put","why":"put-put."},{"s":"Staff ___ customers first. (put, present)","a":"put","why":"put."},{"s":"Let me ___ it simply. (put)","a":"put","why":"expressar."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["technician","técnico"],["screen","tela"],["repair","conserto"],["warranty","garantia"],["protective glass","película"]]},{"typ